	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Extension Test",
	"Description": "Test only (M6 F14, m6 spec 12 item 7 and 14): a fake consumer plugin that extends GSTNLink and GSTNDefence from outside, through their public API only. GSTNExtTestLink adds a link type (a carry, its roles and a request rule subclass) and GSTNExtTestDefence adds a defensive pipeline step (a brace); their tests prove both work through the existing steps, applier, inbox and fragment with no change to the plugins or the combat model's tick. Never enabled in a shipped configuration.",
